  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "The dragon of the four seasons, summoned to bring balance to the world—among them, the winter guardian dragon, Seherbian Winterbell. Weary of a world that only prays for wishes of fear and curses due to winter’s nature, he falls into a deep ennui. But when Rowan, the dragon priest who had watched over him for so long, dies, Winterbell decides to honor his final wish and journey through the world…\n\n*\"I wish for you to know more of this world, my dragon… Winterbell.\"*\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
